## Customer Health Score

### Health Score Components

| Component | Weight | Metrics |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| Product Adoption | 35% | DAU, feature usage |
| Engagement | 25% | CSM interactions, NPS |
| Support | 15% | Tickets, CSAT, escalations |
| Business Outcomes | 15% | ROI achievement |
| Relationship | 10% | Exec engagement, champion |

### Health Score Calculation

| Score | Status | Action |
|-------|--------|--------|
| 80-100 | Healthy | Standard cadence |
| 60-79 | Needs Attention | Increased engagement |
| 40-59 | At Risk | Action plan required |
| 0-39 | Critical | Executive escalation |

### Health Score Triggers

| Trigger | Impact | Action |
|---------|--------|--------|
| DAU drop >20% | -15 points | Outreach within 48 hrs |
| No login 14+ days | -10 points | Check-in call |
| NPS detractor | -20 points | Recovery call |
| Support escalation | -10 points | CSM involvement |
| Champion departure | -15 points | Exec outreach |

