## Engagement Model

### Touch Cadence by Segment

| Activity | Enterprise | Mid-Market | SMB |
|----------|------------|------------|-----|
| Strategic QBR | Quarterly | Quarterly | — |
| Business Review | Monthly | Bi-monthly | Quarterly |
| Check-in Call | Weekly | Bi-weekly | Monthly |
| Health Report | Monthly | Monthly | Quarterly |
| Exec Engagement | Quarterly | Semi-annual | Annual |

### QBR Framework

**Duration**: 60 minutes

| Section | Time | Content |
|---------|------|---------|
| Executive Summary | 5 min | Health, highlights |
| Value Delivered | 15 min | Metrics, ROI |
| Product Updates | 10 min | New features, roadmap |
| Best Practices | 10 min | Optimization ideas |
| Action Items | 10 min | Next quarter goals |
| Strategic Discussion | 10 min | Future opportunities |

